          shortDescription: 'A South Tyrolean partnership trick-taking game where trumps are chosen in secret. Forehand whispers the trump rank to the dealer; the dealer whispers the trump suit back. Their partners must deduce everything by watching the play. No signals allowed. Information is power.',
