          ai: 'Game: Blind Watten (Ladinisch Watten). 4 players, partnerships. 33-card German deck + WELI. 5 tricks. Trumps chosen SECRETLY: forehand shows rank (Schlag) to dealer, dealer shows suit to forehand. Partners must deduce. No signals. Guate > Rechte > Linken > trumps. Betting to raise stakes. South Tyrolean.',
